<h2>Guest Artist in Tulip Tower 1.0</h2>

<p>
  <b>anuaman (Shuo Wang)</b> (1984 Fushun, China), is an artist and comics researcher.
  He is currently based in Beijing. He has published several comic books, including
  Mr. Door, In Search of Ballads, A Mismatched Pair, Kingdom of Rice, and Street Life,
  among others.
</p>
